  "title": "Auditory Naming EC",
  "description": "This dataset contains intracranial EEG recordings from 121 individuals who performed an auditory-naming task, with electrode coordinates provided in MNI-305 space. The data support analyses of whole-brain, millisecond-scale effective connectivity underlying speech processing, as reported by Kochi et al. (2025).",
  "methods_description": "Intracranial EEG recordings were collected while participants performed an auditory-naming task, with events tagged for stimulus onset (401), stimulus offset (402), and response onset (501). Electrode locations were co-registered to MNI-305 standard space.",
